%% D05 - Generate sequence. The panel validates options, generates a password, evaluates it, and updates the view.
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Panel as GeneratePanel
    participant Options as PasswordOptions
    participant Generator as PasswordGeneratorService
    participant Strength as PasswordStrengthEvaluator
    User->>Panel: Click Generate
    Panel->>Options: Set length and selected categories
    Panel->>Generator: GeneratePassword(options)
    Generator->>Options: GetSelectedSets()
    Options-->>Generator: Selected character sets
    Generator->>Generator: Pick one from each, fill, shuffle
    Generator-->>Panel: Password
    Panel->>Strength: GetScore(password), Evaluate(password)
    Strength-->>Panel: Score and strength
    Panel-->>User: Display password and feedback
